            "case": "fixed",
            "note": "本题 $\\left(\\frac5x+\\frac4y\\right)(x+5y)=25+\\frac{25y}x+\\frac{4x}y$，$\\frac{25y}x\\cdot\\frac{4x}y=100$ 是定值：定积求和。"
          },
          "title": "观察和积结构",
          "position": 3
