            "case": "equal",
            "note": "本题取等要 $\\frac{25y}x=\\frac{4x}y$，即 $2x=5y$，与 $x+5y=1$ 联立得 $x=\\frac13$，$y=\\frac2{15}$，取得到。"
          },
          "title": "验证取等",
          "position": 5
        }
